{"pageProps": {"params": {"versionId": "59", "usfm": "1CH.3.NIV"}, "audioVersionInfo": {"title": "ESV Hear the Word Audio Bible", "copyright_long": {"text": "English: ESV Audio Old and New Testament", "html": "English: ESV Audio Old and New Testament"}, "copyright_short": {"text": "\u2117 2016 Crossway", "html": "<p>\u2117 2016 Crossway</p>"}, "version_id": 59, "id": 1, "publisher_link": "", "dramatized": false, "publisher": {"id": 575, "name": "Hear Book Audio", "local_name": "Hear Book Audio", "url": null, "description": null}}, "type": "chapter", "chapterInfo": {"audioChapterInfo": [{"download_urls": {"format_mp3_32k": "//audio-bible-cdn.youversionapi.com/1/32k/1CH/3-6157eaa0e5c42c3f39b351a67cb4c024.mp3?version_id=59", "format_hls": "//audio-hls.youversionapi.com/1/m4a/32k/1CH/3-6157eaa0e5c42c3f39b351a67cb4c024.m3u8?version_id=59"}, "id": 1, "version_id": 59, "title": "ESV Hear the Word Audio Bible", "timing_available": true, "dramatized": false, "default": true}], "content": "<div class=\"version vid59 iso6393eng\" data-vid=\"59\" data-iso6393=\"eng\">\n    <div class=\"book bk1CH\">\n        <div class=\"chapter ch3\" data-usfm=\"1CH.3\">\n            <div class=\"label\">3</div><div class=\"s1\"><span class=\"heading\">Descendants of David</span></div><div class=\"p\"><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"verse v1\" data-usfm=\"1CH.3.1\"><span class=\"label\">1</span><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">    For ver. 1-4, see 2 Sam. 3:2-5   </span></span><span class=\"content\">These are the sons of David who were born to him in Hebron: the firstborn, Amnon, by Ahinoam the Jezreelite; the second, </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">[2 Sam. 3:3]</span></span><span class=\"content\">Daniel, by Abigail the Carmelite, </span></span><span class=\"verse v2\" data-usfm=\"1CH.3.2\"><span class=\"label\">2</span><span class=\"content\">the third, Absalom, whose mother was Maacah, the daughter of Talmai, king of Geshur; the fourth, Adonijah, whose mother was Haggith; </span></span><span class=\"verse v3\" data-usfm=\"1CH.3.3\"><span class=\"label\">3</span><span class=\"content\">the fifth, Shephatiah, by Abital; the sixth, Ithream, by his wife Eglah; </span></span><span class=\"verse v4\" data-usfm=\"1CH.3.4\"><span class=\"label\">4</span><span class=\"content\">six were born to him in Hebron, </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">2 Sam. 2:11 </span></span><span class=\"content\">where he reigned for seven years and six months. </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">2 Sam. 5:5</span></span><span class=\"content\">And he reigned thirty-three years in Jerusalem. </span></span><span class=\"verse v5\" data-usfm=\"1CH.3.5\"><span class=\"label\">5</span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">For ver. 5-8, see ch. 14:4-7; 2 Sam. 5:14-16 </span></span><span class=\"content\">These were born to him in Jerusalem: </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">[ch. 14:4; 2 Sam. 5:14] </span></span><span class=\"content\">Shimea, Shobab, Nathan and </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">2 Sam. 12:24 </span></span><span class=\"content\">Solomon, four by </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">[2 Sam. 11:3]</span></span><span class=\"content\">Bath-shua, the daughter of </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">[2 Sam. 11:3]</span></span><span class=\"content\">Ammiel; </span></span><span class=\"verse v6\" data-usfm=\"1CH.3.6\"><span class=\"label\">6</span><span class=\"content\">then Ibhar, </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">[ch. 14:5; 2 Sam. 5:15]</span></span><span class=\"content\">Elishama, Eliphelet, </span></span><span class=\"verse v7\" data-usfm=\"1CH.3.7\"><span class=\"label\">7</span><span class=\"content\">Nogah, Nepheg, Japhia, </span></span><span class=\"verse v8\" data-usfm=\"1CH.3.8\"><span class=\"label\">8</span><span class=\"content\">Elishama, </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">[ch. 14:7]</span></span><span class=\"content\">Eliada, and Eliphelet, nine. </span></span><span class=\"verse v9\" data-usfm=\"1CH.3.9\"><span class=\"label\">9</span><span class=\"content\">All these were David&#8217;s sons, besides the sons of the concubines, </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">2 Sam. 13:1</span></span><span class=\"content\">and Tamar was their sister.</span></span></div><div class=\"p\"><span class=\"verse v9\" data-usfm=\"1CH.3.9\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v10\" data-usfm=\"1CH.3.10\"><span class=\"label\">10</span><span class=\"content\">The son of Solomon was </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">1 Kgs. 11:43 </span></span><span class=\"content\">Rehoboam, </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">[1 Kgs. 14:31; 15:1] </span></span><span class=\"content\">Abijah his son, </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">1 Kgs. 15:8 </span></span><span class=\"content\">Asa his son, </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">1 Kgs. 15:24</span></span><span class=\"content\">Jehoshaphat his son, </span></span><span class=\"verse v11\" data-usfm=\"1CH.3.11\"><span class=\"label\">11</span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">2 Kgs. 8:16 </span></span><span class=\"content\">Joram his son, </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">2 Kgs. 8:24; [2 Chr. 21:17; 22:6] </span></span><span class=\"content\">Ahaziah his son, </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">2 Kgs. 11:2</span></span><span class=\"content\">Joash his son, </span></span><span class=\"verse v12\" data-usfm=\"1CH.3.12\"><span class=\"label\">12</span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">2 Kgs. 12:21 </span></span><span class=\"content\">Amaziah his son, </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">[2 Kgs. 15:30] </span></span><span class=\"content\">Azariah his son, </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">2 Kgs. 15:7</span></span><span class=\"content\">Jotham his son, </span></span><span class=\"verse v13\" data-usfm=\"1CH.3.13\"><span class=\"label\">13</span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">2 Kgs. 15:38 </span></span><span class=\"content\">Ahaz his son, </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">2 Kgs. 16:20 </span></span><span class=\"content\">Hezekiah his son, </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">2 Kgs. 20:21</span></span><span class=\"content\">Manasseh his son, </span></span><span class=\"verse v14\" data-usfm=\"1CH.3.14\"><span class=\"label\">14</span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">2 Kgs. 21:18 </span></span><span class=\"content\">Amon his son, </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">2 Kgs. 21:26</span></span><span class=\"content\">Josiah his son. </span></span><span class=\"verse v15\" data-usfm=\"1CH.3.15\"><span class=\"label\">15</span><span class=\"content\">The sons of Josiah: </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">[2 Kgs. 23:30] </span></span><span class=\"content\">Johanan the firstborn, the second </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">[2 Kgs. 23:34] </span></span><span class=\"content\">Jehoiakim, the third </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">[2 Kgs. 24:17]</span></span><span class=\"content\">Zedekiah, the fourth Shallum. </span></span><span class=\"verse v16\" data-usfm=\"1CH.3.16\"><span class=\"label\">16</span><span class=\"content\">The descendants of </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">[Matt. 1:11] </span></span><span class=\"content\">Jehoiakim: </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">[2 Kgs. 24:6; Jer. 22:24] </span></span><span class=\"content\">Jeconiah his son, </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">[2 Kgs. 24:17]</span></span><span class=\"content\">Zedekiah his son; </span></span><span class=\"verse v17\" data-usfm=\"1CH.3.17\"><span class=\"label\">17</span><span class=\"content\">and the sons of Jeconiah, the </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">2 Kgs. 24:15 </span></span><span class=\"content\">captive: </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Ezra 3:2; 5:2; Hag. 1:1, 12, 14; 2:2, 23; Matt. 1:12; Luke 3:27</span></span><span class=\"content\">Shealtiel his son, </span></span><span class=\"verse v18\" data-usfm=\"1CH.3.18\"><span class=\"label\">18</span><span class=\"content\">Malchiram, Pedaiah, Shenazzar, Jekamiah, Hoshama and Nedabiah; </span></span><span class=\"verse v19\" data-usfm=\"1CH.3.19\"><span class=\"label\">19</span><span class=\"content\">and the sons of Pedaiah: </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Ezra 2:2; Hag. 1:1, 12, 14; Zech. 4:6</span></span><span class=\"content\">Zerubbabel and Shimei; and the sons of </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Ezra 2:2; Hag. 1:1, 12, 14; Zech. 4:6</span></span><span class=\"content\">Zerubbabel: Meshullam and Hananiah, and Shelomith was their sister; </span></span><span class=\"verse v20\" data-usfm=\"1CH.3.20\"><span class=\"label\">20</span><span class=\"content\">and Hashubah, Ohel, Berechiah, Hasadiah, and Jushab-hesed, five. </span></span><span class=\"verse v21\" data-usfm=\"1CH.3.21\"><span class=\"label\">21</span><span class=\"content\">The sons of Hananiah: Pelatiah and Jeshaiah, his son</span><span class=\"note f\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\"><span class=\"fr\">3:21 </span><span class=\"ft\">Septuagint (compare Syriac, Vulgate); Hebrew </span><span class=\"fq\">sons of</span><span class=\"ft\">; four times in this verse</span></span></span><span class=\"content\"> Rephaiah, his son Arnan, his son Obadiah, his son Shecaniah. </span></span><span class=\"verse v22\" data-usfm=\"1CH.3.22\"><span class=\"label\">22</span><span class=\"content\">The son</span><span class=\"note f\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\"><span class=\"fr\">3:22 </span><span class=\"ft\">Hebrew </span><span class=\"fq\">sons</span></span></span><span class=\"content\"> of Shecaniah: </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Neh. 3:29 </span></span><span class=\"content\">Shemaiah. And the sons of Shemaiah: </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Ezra 8:2</span></span><span class=\"content\">Hattush, Igal, Bariah, Neariah, and Shaphat, six. </span></span><span class=\"verse v23\" data-usfm=\"1CH.3.23\"><span class=\"label\">23</span><span class=\"content\">The sons of Neariah: Elioenai, Hizkiah, and Azrikam, three. </span></span><span class=\"verse v24\" data-usfm=\"1CH.3.24\"><span class=\"label\">24</span><span class=\"content\">The sons of Elioenai: Hodaviah, Eliashib, Pelaiah, Akkub, Johanan, Delaiah, and Anani, seven.</span></span></div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>", "copyright": {"html": "<p>The Holy Bible, English Standard Version\u00ae (ESV\u00ae), copyright \u00a9 2001 by Crossway, a publishing ministry of Good News Publishers.</p>", "text": "The Holy Bible, English Standard Version\u00ae (ESV\u00ae), copyright \u00a9 2001 by Crossway, a publishing ministry of Good News Publishers."}, "next": {"canonical": true, "usfm": ["1CH.4"], "human": "1 Chronicles 4", "toc": true, "version_id": 59}, "previous": {"canonical": true, "usfm": ["1CH.2"], "human": "1 Chronicles 2", "toc": true, "version_id": 59}, "reference": {"usfm": ["1CH.3"], "human": "1 Chronicles 3", "version_id": 59}}, "usfm": "1CH.3.NIV", "locale": "en", "versionData": {"audio": true, "copyright_short": {"html": "<p>The Holy Bible, English Standard Version\u00ae (ESV\u00ae), copyright \u00a9 2001 by Crossway, a publishing ministry of Good News Publishers.</p>", "text": "The Holy Bible, English Standard Version\u00ae (ESV\u00ae), copyright \u00a9 2001 by Crossway, a publishing ministry of Good News Publishers."}, "id": 59, "language": {"iso_639_1": "en", "iso_639_3": "eng", "language_tag": "eng", "local_name": "English", "text_direction": "ltr"}, "local_abbreviation": "ESV", "local_title": "English Standard Version 2016", "publisher": {"name": "Crossway / Good News Publishers"}, "reader_footer": {"html": "<p>The Holy Bible, English Standard Version\u00ae (ESV\u00ae), copyright \u00a9 2001 by Crossway, a publishing ministry of Good News Publishers.</p> \r\n<p>Sign up to receive news and updates about the ESV:</p>", "text": "The Holy Bible, English Standard Version\u00ae (ESV\u00ae), copyright \u00a9 2001 by Crossway, a publishing ministry of Good News Publishers. \r\nSign up to receive news and updates about the ESV:"}, "reader_footer_url": "https://mailchi.mp/23d38157d688/dfka2d5wyd"}, "_nextI18Next": {"initialI18nStore": {"en": {"common": {"app_download_open": "App Download or Open Button", "average_rating_stars": "Average rating: {{star_count}} stars.", "bible": "Bible", "bibles": "Bibles", "choose_you